        "node_id": "n_5_579e5c",
        "thought_text": "I understand the issue. The current approach doesn't correctly handle cases where the sum of the first half equals the sum of the second half. Instead, we need to ensure that the sum of the first half is equal to the sum of the second half plus the last odd number in the second half. This adjustment will correctly solve the problem for all test cases.",
